#### [MODIFY] [server.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/server.js)
- Add `recalculation_log` table initialization in [initUserSchema](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/server.js#156-248).
- Create `GET /api/base-year-recalculation` to fetch the log history.
- Create `POST /api/base-year-recalculation` to set the base year and record the reason in the log.
