## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- **Recalculation Log**: Change the base year with a reason, then verify it appears in the "Recalculation History" on the compliance page.
- **Verification Report**: Click the "Generate Audit-Ready Verification Report" button and verify the resulting PDF contains all required auditor information.
